{
  "schema": "tennislive.voice-quality.v1.inventory",
  "bundle_sha256": "0bb1e7d1cb77e90d517f7f1adbe5596ea8d28b1d3b536828ec2d7174ff8c713b",
  "bundle_request_count": 25,
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "bundle:04bb77a0b9a7dec5341c15ee4d06326c406ec8ca4c112dcc7b1de5fb82685016",
      "request_id": "04bb77a0b9a7dec5341c15ee4d06326c406ec8ca4c112dcc7b1de5fb82685016",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "c06b5ce77f3045cf4f7815a9e4179732",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "28岁才赢大满贯，41岁在家乡谢幕。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "be779f8c2060c29eae68ac91fc7571109464666c3a9ce6bde3ec5fc97490d96c",
      "words_sha256": "ea3cbb0848fde4bfa441fe983c7ce492ee62cf21d9f964144693b991576986a2"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:0622826db4690cde3e259689e6d48d9c0b007d539cc6d6611be69e02c7ba2304",
      "request_id": "0622826db4690cde3e259689e6d48d9c0b007d539cc6d6611be69e02c7ba2304",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "cd319c69784a20453e57c51ffad9e0c3",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "很多人第一次记住他，是二零零八年北京奥运会。二十三岁的他，和费德勒搭档，拿下了男双金牌。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "eb78b191b1b79aca712c8792f9b89e203ebbf3b529773bf4923b11521945eae8",
      "words_sha256": "01de80b5da1d0d3a492308eeadfa3bcc3f0b5e0a99e44e2da31541185ba0f9f6"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:0655aa8775834c36fb5474ffacd7446fd90ee14005218cb109abcc8807d01cf4",
      "request_id": "0655aa8775834c36fb5474ffacd7446fd90ee14005218cb109abcc8807d01cf4",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "86955c8b9d02f73e0a3731d3f2921714",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "一年后，同一块场地，他决胜盘九比七赢了德约，终结了对手在澳网的二十五连胜。五天后的决赛，对面是世界第一纳达尔。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "8ef237c48564dbaa0ba58347736e444e9725237cc0bce63e3076e4a5127ff10f",
      "words_sha256": "16e02b4312503bdb8c6261f978289ec6dca1d52493a4c983572d74aa9c8aa835"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:085e0f6c1a277d5e689ec6c32287c0d9b96f67ce0bad26d84e39ba25456c36cb",
      "request_id": "085e0f6c1a277d5e689ec6c32287c0d9b96f67ce0bad26d84e39ba25456c36cb",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "ecef540fabfe4c914e81da465922fc3d",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "三个月后，蒙特卡洛大师赛决赛，对面是费德勒。先丢一盘，他逆转拿下，这是他生涯唯一一座大师赛冠军。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "de867cfc500465af85c42668aec9c8926fa475448b7d51a694a96bbaebbc1170",
      "words_sha256": "28d741402516e2da8ed8afd873e5f3fab8f452c96e12f58da22b24e0635aedf7"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:0a608b536ae8eef53fa7c27ea88a3b5cd2e63bb796e83ab7f35eb6d6af84059d",
      "request_id": "0a608b536ae8eef53fa7c27ea88a3b5cd2e63bb796e83ab7f35eb6d6af84059d",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "bc6535d2dab2bd0cf52e02816a822b70",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "那年十一月，戴维斯杯决赛在法国里尔。他先拿下首场单打，又和费德勒赢下双打。最后一天，费德勒锁定胜局，瑞士第一次捧起了戴维斯杯。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "e104909775b08d0175888c3edbd7b239fb917353366bb19167c9b77eac299114",
      "words_sha256": "b03b9e8be378d87d84b57eb3a05dadb7d7ae601648012d23d326b89b91565326"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:0b3fe91847511338b6e2c2af251ba9f5361d0cd1c3ae0063438c9ed6bf094c8e",
      "request_id": "0b3fe91847511338b6e2c2af251ba9f5361d0cd1c3ae0063438c9ed6bf094c8e",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "68c7866d64ecf2a34c4f64e579885e35",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "二零一五年法网，四分之一决赛，他直落三盘赢了费德勒。决赛，又是世界第一德约。那一年德约拿了另外三个大满贯，唯独这一个，被他拿走。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "8cd2c3c7d06b5f468d1c5317a2c9ded58864af0bd634ac68c91f3a02c484a0a3",
      "words_sha256": "184c3e8fb21697e26a076467e7cc0df522691aa75207db2e68c863e413d7af54"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:1febdf10b2aab154c70a3332ae8b531e503d90d824aa27fbab3f6ed535e51288",
      "request_id": "1febdf10b2aab154c70a3332ae8b531e503d90d824aa27fbab3f6ed535e51288",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "4a312559eeea5b8dec5e487448d2b319",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "八月三十一日，美网首轮，他又输给了贝雷蒂尼。这是他最后一场大满贯比赛。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "7ebd48d0974ff830ec291a9dd840a755c5a425a9fc0f569510eee9838bce550c",
      "words_sha256": "0e5a7f193e092e91389121b32da27edc901c0a983228ce4553449f3fb1bef193"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:20e05ef31f8f89cabc2c8efbff14a2de3fdeb372ecf90c54a4eb433a452f97db",
      "request_id": "20e05ef31f8f89cabc2c8efbff14a2de3fdeb372ecf90c54a4eb433a452f97db",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "d5960ab7802f1a901d7e6c484e8df7c9",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "最后一站，是家乡巴塞尔。十月二十六日晚上，球场为他办了一场告别，费德勒发来了一段视频。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "c555b892620efa6931ff2b461df0d59c85465230e67dbced71c76dffe41f3074",
      "words_sha256": "b59f57dca04ea02afeb31dab9803ee48600cedb1560db64ac8f4ec5db66bfa65"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:311d559526935ade171eee2247aa869244ac2ea54f96b11ea2fe6fa11cf4b60a",
      "request_id": "311d559526935ade171eee2247aa869244ac2ea54f96b11ea2fe6fa11cf4b60a",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "6b920c4af20e1767a0c172a2779a3f42",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "六月三十日，温网首轮，他和贝雷蒂尼鏖战四小时二十分钟。四盘，全都打进了抢七。第二盘他握有六个盘点，抢七十六比十八还是输了。温网破例，给了输球的他一次场上采访。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "5b7376367cf722c64494f2a058272cd1a9007071a1ff4b7caa0cfcf505e69105",
      "words_sha256": "a4a8ff086b2014da05e8612ec91b87e7343d2633042d536069510530037ce121"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:327de31a4b272d5d7377e39b506fef5278d3148edc528306e60e824a3a5cfef6",
      "request_id": "327de31a4b272d5d7377e39b506fef5278d3148edc528306e60e824a3a5cfef6",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "f3b17c8fd0031a93ac8e6706bbab0a8a",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "可在单打里，他一直站在费德勒身后。二零一三年澳网第四轮，二十七岁的他，对面是世界第一德约科维奇。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "9e0ffc98e4b7e9aadb96fae4c97e29c0dfc92e72b62851b03e271695bee8c94c",
      "words_sha256": "b879abec60b4b7bd8d12dd2eafc21853f40dc4ebf08adc4b2e44f4e6f0359e77"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:56572eaada17a50967662eb2f8c0fb1d7815448993747ba3a5462e4751cad397",
      "request_id": "56572eaada17a50967662eb2f8c0fb1d7815448993747ba3a5462e4751cad397",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "ea15e49725d6c37a8470a60b78f08b8f",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "二零二六年，最后一个赛季。四十岁的他拿外卡打进澳网第三轮，是一九七八年以来的第一人。输球之后，他对看台说了这样几句话。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "48da029b712522b805e6800b39223b634f013b80ba5eb27cd86953ef72f768c1",
      "words_sha256": "3498c240d4b29c139547b5af3efe11d526d2550cde3f015cbcf6d8f2c44f0dbb"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:5d38ec3819c74db634bb477ab9f3982d336d4f70a0b254039ba01ec2369e3f0e",
      "request_id": "5d38ec3819c74db634bb477ab9f3982d336d4f70a0b254039ba01ec2369e3f0e",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "751bae8c5c061488a8b9d032b10d1926",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "三次大满贯决赛，三个世界第一，他一场没输。来得晚的巅峰，一样是巅峰。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "aeaeaaed9207e3965bc998f748b82b4334168e8847a05123658d620532bcc1df",
      "words_sha256": "54bf49595934fb8bf0908607eabb6f73b6fe047ef444d99ed3f359d701d2c123"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:85a29de8dca0d94a7368a1a3560f8da42067bd1484c29857409ba150b52d16d9",
      "request_id": "85a29de8dca0d94a7368a1a3560f8da42067bd1484c29857409ba150b52d16d9",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "e8069aa5215a06f313bbd25c1dd07a96",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "最后，他绕场一周。手机灯光亮起来，像给他点了一场星海。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "6031443c246266086f8062723c5526cc2ed6b8e1be9f690fd554f169b5556d2e",
      "words_sha256": "aece74faca0030eac0a4fd1d24806060090ad83eef07600df2060d45afb2814e"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:a2013daee904178f77eeefa089e8cdc5ef485fa2fff4156a6d76645c62ff05da",
      "request_id": "a2013daee904178f77eeefa089e8cdc5ef485fa2fff4156a6d76645c62ff05da",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "c575e4c2a3c07db6f19f4e9397c08bef",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "决赛，他输给了纳达尔，二比六、三比六、一比六。这是他四次大满贯决赛里，唯一输掉的一次。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "c36713d09b3437625aa4d8e4c533776204fca0afb22ea62b14622a37862cba52",
      "words_sha256": "9b35fb7e15803a442ced9eb620d9886f214b95e79ea556641e1d37728cc45b98"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:a502c4f1978f4c145bfa5beb9a017c51c5451df23cdb9ae0e08b9987ea94c858",
      "request_id": "a502c4f1978f4c145bfa5beb9a017c51c5451df23cdb9ae0e08b9987ea94c858",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "452c4e9ec924b084ffacbc427d61949b",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "第二天晚上，同一块场地，他打了职业生涯的最后一场比赛。五比七，六比七，他输给了八号种子莱赫奇卡。全场的掌声，都给了他。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "4eebf44ed489e506c26a1c4c5fef7ea3cf7b299aa586ed576399602a55046e96",
      "words_sha256": "7c8c39bb54bda13f6f5ce1ca5de1bb7ade4e0f3beceaa7b83cc1d561e2d48916"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:a7b3c52a66598713d34456e993a31ef02fe9c7ea1a595f3d2f9bfba6fd25d96d",
      "request_id": "a7b3c52a66598713d34456e993a31ef02fe9c7ea1a595f3d2f9bfba6fd25d96d",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "deded99cd0ebf41a33cb507a6366cba8",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "二零一七年法网半决赛，三十二岁的他，和头号种子穆雷打了四小时三十四分钟。决胜盘六比一，他打进了第四次大满贯决赛。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "78ca193b71ce7060ec296efcc410a266470f6d5b2279fe6098badc2b626555d0",
      "words_sha256": "e2b39cbf6fe9c12a70e27c5af60ca8d3d99da74f22770ca5e63ad0bfe58ec66a"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:af197ec9289c9ac6720b774cfa61cf2c63de30940ce64d41095013d6f9946f99",
      "request_id": "af197ec9289c9ac6720b774cfa61cf2c63de30940ce64d41095013d6f9946f99",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "8a6521bf914a5af60647d7287ef25962",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "试过，败过。再试，再败，败得更好。三座大满贯之后，他在家乡说了再见。你最记得他的哪一场？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "db0da532d79b59c22aa35b5e1a12251d2c42f1f8e4de6e019e0862bca44ad8e4",
      "words_sha256": "76bdafcfac0f39de08b9940551404407c1049a7d09b3e758768ebc62b924da1c"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:b7a3239ecb58806fa2323620a07e1e0b895cd5ee6c35d4e7e4362195c3812cd5",
      "request_id": "b7a3239ecb58806fa2323620a07e1e0b895cd5ee6c35d4e7e4362195c3812cd5",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "4080669936c11b53203142371057efcb",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "那年八月，三十二岁的他左膝连做两次手术，排名后来跌到两百六十名开外。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "cb08a9a053da7c81e9a836cb9ebd90ffeb513ad7a2c28d1dddc0f07ba57a4117",
      "words_sha256": "1c798058f12ac58930f9854a67f49b5ac85cf054e46d82e9dcb996c7aeb2eebd"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:b80ad40cf03e2a1bf0849f74b5dd89f9591e3dfac6354816bf5cd093c739d31d",
      "request_id": "b80ad40cf03e2a1bf0849f74b5dd89f9591e3dfac6354816bf5cd093c739d31d",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "20da8f5468902afbbecb78daefb15d83",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "关注网球时插，时插归我，好球归你。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "81e221c9c5314ca919a2f4b5ee85461807900efe238a996bbab8b39815affb67",
      "words_sha256": "ffd92401e4e51d044cd0ba811dd56c27dfa59f0de4734ee872348e09ba3401b8"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:ba900cc4e130c084c2965cc989a8040847174b8a6bf602316ae6c0a3e339603f",
      "request_id": "ba900cc4e130c084c2965cc989a8040847174b8a6bf602316ae6c0a3e339603f",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "c7324b644a141946e12e5977446a0b36",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "二零二六年十月二十七日夜里，巴塞尔。四十一岁的瓦林卡，在家乡，打完了职业生涯的最后一场比赛。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "6404b8873a29ac99be141e6b357f3853d6c09cb3fb4f0c8c29072971ada2fadc",
      "words_sha256": "3bf26440a352ab87200f39425be9147eb66713c527763d9d64b5cab7b7966295"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:c2a5ec36036b6466c13ba581ea31f9a4c50450df27e68ee3c9f5df501c92c814",
      "request_id": "c2a5ec36036b6466c13ba581ea31f9a4c50450df27e68ee3c9f5df501c92c814",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "d77d27b5ca9bb4897b5c64d375de63a9",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "他背起球包，手放在胸口，向看台挥了挥手。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "c20cce1b54a0cca0d9503932c3f02dd9636269e9592cdb9981e1c9b32b5ac70c",
      "words_sha256": "36c2a017e3ff7edbcb29dd9bbca834f665b1410c23c210c2c180a0b2d4346285"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:c633fd06f3da155f31021ade5b8b6ff073f3285de5b0fc0ffde03680018c7ab1",
      "request_id": "c633fd06f3da155f31021ade5b8b6ff073f3285de5b0fc0ffde03680018c7ab1",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "8670c24a129a067ddf1545ef0ed7d3b7",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "五小时两分钟，决胜盘十比十二，他输了。赛后他却说，这是他打过最好的一场球。他的左臂上，纹着贝克特的一句话：再试，再败，败得更好。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "c2f929b2ee3af53612e32c09c46c5da4ec37240f0a38ea8c540db9d003d383cb",
      "words_sha256": "9cac2e46db7076e819ad24d2a4bafb6610ccb93c9a6df9c83f609f282da15bad"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:cccd721ebf545e6865f63690c5c0ba8fa55f772c0fb7a745754a7e00bdbf0a15",
      "request_id": "cccd721ebf545e6865f63690c5c0ba8fa55f772c0fb7a745754a7e00bdbf0a15",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "5b5ab4bc67c35ba19230f9e6b0cf07c9",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "二零一六年美网第三轮，他一度只差一分就出局。决赛，他第三次在大满贯决赛面对世界第一。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "193799bfda1d2af9a24ac814d0aaf31b20fc6904172f8368fd50cb283f1e3cbe",
      "words_sha256": "ce1f42130c721c09548517e0856ee982c77ce10138c9ddbac5e0457159778f67"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:d01b2de40ff63d033eeebe738589b136e516cbf01e29a8f05f49426c37de387b",
      "request_id": "d01b2de40ff63d033eeebe738589b136e516cbf01e29a8f05f49426c37de387b",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "7d7a7fdec1ae2e8143cd8ad2d1852c77",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "他又爬了回来。二零一九年法网，三十四岁的他，和二十岁的西西帕斯打了五小时零九分钟。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "c88b702d2da27b8d6c3b6ca72f3e161653ca856b7dcf3c8dcad16eb43d8e1b5f",
      "words_sha256": "c0a5f5ebadc964cc48193728855bf156ac85454811286fa098f67977470558b1"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:fa6de90f365019f91793c111e936992244a88caf536c30424f94c51c038422e6",
      "request_id": "fa6de90f365019f91793c111e936992244a88caf536c30424f94c51c038422e6",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "67346bb853a050f488de3c4ef9e2e798",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "五月，罗兰·加洛斯为他办了告别仪式。他一次次抬手擦眼泪；看台上的人全站了起来，掌声很久都没有停。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "2e56486fb09b4afee8df6420d917b985a7ef606e13234af97b2e21442273b535",
      "words_sha256": "0b6fc804641292f318ce699cf36763fd8f09447dee0efb85fc59c312cbc2cd0f"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_01.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "6404b8873a29ac99be141e6b357f3853d6c09cb3fb4f0c8c29072971ada2fadc",
      "words_sha256": "3bf26440a352ab87200f39425be9147eb66713c527763d9d64b5cab7b7966295",
      "words_path": "voice_01.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "c7324b644a141946e12e5977446a0b36",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "二零二六年十月二十七日夜里，巴塞尔。四十一岁的瓦林卡，在家乡，打完了职业生涯的最后一场比赛。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_02.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "eb78b191b1b79aca712c8792f9b89e203ebbf3b529773bf4923b11521945eae8",
      "words_sha256": "01de80b5da1d0d3a492308eeadfa3bcc3f0b5e0a99e44e2da31541185ba0f9f6",
      "words_path": "voice_02.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "cd319c69784a20453e57c51ffad9e0c3",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "很多人第一次记住他，是二零零八年北京奥运会。二十三岁的他，和费德勒搭档，拿下了男双金牌。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_04.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "9e0ffc98e4b7e9aadb96fae4c97e29c0dfc92e72b62851b03e271695bee8c94c",
      "words_sha256": "b879abec60b4b7bd8d12dd2eafc21853f40dc4ebf08adc4b2e44f4e6f0359e77",
      "words_path": "voice_04.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "f3b17c8fd0031a93ac8e6706bbab0a8a",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "可在单打里，他一直站在费德勒身后。二零一三年澳网第四轮，二十七岁的他，对面是世界第一德约科维奇。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_06.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "c2f929b2ee3af53612e32c09c46c5da4ec37240f0a38ea8c540db9d003d383cb",
      "words_sha256": "9cac2e46db7076e819ad24d2a4bafb6610ccb93c9a6df9c83f609f282da15bad",
      "words_path": "voice_06.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "8670c24a129a067ddf1545ef0ed7d3b7",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "五小时两分钟，决胜盘十比十二，他输了。赛后他却说，这是他打过最好的一场球。他的左臂上，纹着贝克特的一句话：再试，再败，败得更好。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_07.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "8ef237c48564dbaa0ba58347736e444e9725237cc0bce63e3076e4a5127ff10f",
      "words_sha256": "16e02b4312503bdb8c6261f978289ec6dca1d52493a4c983572d74aa9c8aa835",
      "words_path": "voice_07.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "86955c8b9d02f73e0a3731d3f2921714",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "一年后，同一块场地，他决胜盘九比七赢了德约，终结了对手在澳网的二十五连胜。五天后的决赛，对面是世界第一纳达尔。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_09.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "de867cfc500465af85c42668aec9c8926fa475448b7d51a694a96bbaebbc1170",
      "words_sha256": "28d741402516e2da8ed8afd873e5f3fab8f452c96e12f58da22b24e0635aedf7",
      "words_path": "voice_09.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "ecef540fabfe4c914e81da465922fc3d",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "三个月后，蒙特卡洛大师赛决赛，对面是费德勒。先丢一盘，他逆转拿下，这是他生涯唯一一座大师赛冠军。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_11.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "e104909775b08d0175888c3edbd7b239fb917353366bb19167c9b77eac299114",
      "words_sha256": "b03b9e8be378d87d84b57eb3a05dadb7d7ae601648012d23d326b89b91565326",
      "words_path": "voice_11.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "bc6535d2dab2bd0cf52e02816a822b70",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "那年十一月，戴维斯杯决赛在法国里尔。他先拿下首场单打，又和费德勒赢下双打。最后一天，费德勒锁定胜局，瑞士第一次捧起了戴维斯杯。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_13.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "8cd2c3c7d06b5f468d1c5317a2c9ded58864af0bd634ac68c91f3a02c484a0a3",
      "words_sha256": "184c3e8fb21697e26a076467e7cc0df522691aa75207db2e68c863e413d7af54",
      "words_path": "voice_13.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "68c7866d64ecf2a34c4f64e579885e35",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "二零一五年法网，四分之一决赛，他直落三盘赢了费德勒。决赛，又是世界第一德约。那一年德约拿了另外三个大满贯，唯独这一个，被他拿走。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_16.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "193799bfda1d2af9a24ac814d0aaf31b20fc6904172f8368fd50cb283f1e3cbe",
      "words_sha256": "ce1f42130c721c09548517e0856ee982c77ce10138c9ddbac5e0457159778f67",
      "words_path": "voice_16.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "5b5ab4bc67c35ba19230f9e6b0cf07c9",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "二零一六年美网第三轮，他一度只差一分就出局。决赛，他第三次在大满贯决赛面对世界第一。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_18.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "aeaeaaed9207e3965bc998f748b82b4334168e8847a05123658d620532bcc1df",
      "words_sha256": "54bf49595934fb8bf0908607eabb6f73b6fe047ef444d99ed3f359d701d2c123",
      "words_path": "voice_18.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "751bae8c5c061488a8b9d032b10d1926",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "三次大满贯决赛，三个世界第一，他一场没输。来得晚的巅峰，一样是巅峰。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_19.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "78ca193b71ce7060ec296efcc410a266470f6d5b2279fe6098badc2b626555d0",
      "words_sha256": "e2b39cbf6fe9c12a70e27c5af60ca8d3d99da74f22770ca5e63ad0bfe58ec66a",
      "words_path": "voice_19.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "deded99cd0ebf41a33cb507a6366cba8",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "二零一七年法网半决赛，三十二岁的他，和头号种子穆雷打了四小时三十四分钟。决胜盘六比一，他打进了第四次大满贯决赛。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_21.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "c36713d09b3437625aa4d8e4c533776204fca0afb22ea62b14622a37862cba52",
      "words_sha256": "9b35fb7e15803a442ced9eb620d9886f214b95e79ea556641e1d37728cc45b98",
      "words_path": "voice_21.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "c575e4c2a3c07db6f19f4e9397c08bef",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "决赛，他输给了纳达尔，二比六、三比六、一比六。这是他四次大满贯决赛里，唯一输掉的一次。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_23.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "cb08a9a053da7c81e9a836cb9ebd90ffeb513ad7a2c28d1dddc0f07ba57a4117",
      "words_sha256": "1c798058f12ac58930f9854a67f49b5ac85cf054e46d82e9dcb996c7aeb2eebd",
      "words_path": "voice_23.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "4080669936c11b53203142371057efcb",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "那年八月，三十二岁的他左膝连做两次手术，排名后来跌到两百六十名开外。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_24.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "c88b702d2da27b8d6c3b6ca72f3e161653ca856b7dcf3c8dcad16eb43d8e1b5f",
      "words_sha256": "c0a5f5ebadc964cc48193728855bf156ac85454811286fa098f67977470558b1",
      "words_path": "voice_24.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "7d7a7fdec1ae2e8143cd8ad2d1852c77",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "他又爬了回来。二零一九年法网，三十四岁的他，和二十岁的西西帕斯打了五小时零九分钟。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_26.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "48da029b712522b805e6800b39223b634f013b80ba5eb27cd86953ef72f768c1",
      "words_sha256": "3498c240d4b29c139547b5af3efe11d526d2550cde3f015cbcf6d8f2c44f0dbb",
      "words_path": "voice_26.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "ea15e49725d6c37a8470a60b78f08b8f",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "二零二六年，最后一个赛季。四十岁的他拿外卡打进澳网第三轮，是一九七八年以来的第一人。输球之后，他对看台说了这样几句话。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_29.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "2e56486fb09b4afee8df6420d917b985a7ef606e13234af97b2e21442273b535",
      "words_sha256": "0b6fc804641292f318ce699cf36763fd8f09447dee0efb85fc59c312cbc2cd0f",
      "words_path": "voice_29.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "67346bb853a050f488de3c4ef9e2e798",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "五月，罗兰·加洛斯为他办了告别仪式。他一次次抬手擦眼泪；看台上的人全站了起来，掌声很久都没有停。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_30.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "5b7376367cf722c64494f2a058272cd1a9007071a1ff4b7caa0cfcf505e69105",
      "words_sha256": "a4a8ff086b2014da05e8612ec91b87e7343d2633042d536069510530037ce121",
      "words_path": "voice_30.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "6b920c4af20e1767a0c172a2779a3f42",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "六月三十日，温网首轮，他和贝雷蒂尼鏖战四小时二十分钟。四盘，全都打进了抢七。第二盘他握有六个盘点，抢七十六比十八还是输了。温网破例，给了输球的他一次场上采访。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_32.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "7ebd48d0974ff830ec291a9dd840a755c5a425a9fc0f569510eee9838bce550c",
      "words_sha256": "0e5a7f193e092e91389121b32da27edc901c0a983228ce4553449f3fb1bef193",
      "words_path": "voice_32.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "4a312559eeea5b8dec5e487448d2b319",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "八月三十一日，美网首轮，他又输给了贝雷蒂尼。这是他最后一场大满贯比赛。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_35.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "c555b892620efa6931ff2b461df0d59c85465230e67dbced71c76dffe41f3074",
      "words_sha256": "b59f57dca04ea02afeb31dab9803ee48600cedb1560db64ac8f4ec5db66bfa65",
      "words_path": "voice_35.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "d5960ab7802f1a901d7e6c484e8df7c9",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "最后一站，是家乡巴塞尔。十月二十六日晚上，球场为他办了一场告别，费德勒发来了一段视频。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_38.mp3",
